---
import LabLayout from '../../layouts/LabLayout.astro';
import {experiments,categories} from '../../creative-lab/registry';
import {url} from '../../lib/urls';
const working=experiments.filter(e=>!e.placeholder).length,planned=experiments.length-working;
---
<LabLayout title="The Impossible Lab" description="An artist’s notebook for reusable web inventions. Explore working studies, keep configurations, and take the complete source into your next project.">
 <header class="il-intro"><div><span class="il-label">AN OPEN NOTEBOOK / EST. 2026</span><h1>The impossible<br/><em>is a starting point.</em></h1><p>A collection of small inventions for the web.<br/>Try them. Take them apart. Make something else.</p></div><div class="il-hero-plate"><img src={url('lab/hinge-study/plate.svg')} width="400" height="266" alt="Fine pencil lines form an open mechanical flower"/><span class="il-annotation">leave room for the unexpected.</span><span class="il-plate-note">{working} WORKING STUDIES.<br/>{planned} QUESTIONS TO FOLLOW.</span></div></header>
 <section class="il-catalog" data-catalog aria-labelledby="collection-title">
  <div class="il-section-title"><h2 id="collection-title">The collection <sup>{String(experiments.length).padStart(2,'0')}</sup></h2><span class="il-label">WORKS IN PROGRESS WELCOME</span></div>
  <form class="il-filters" data-catalog-filters role="search"><label class="il-search">Find a study<input type="search" name="query" placeholder="Ink, paper, sound, space…" autocomplete="off"/></label><label>Discipline<select name="category"><option value="">All disciplines</option>{categories.map(category=><option>{category}</option>)}</select></label><label>Development<select name="status"><option value="">Every stage</option><option value="working">Working</option><option value="prototype">Prototype / planned</option><option value="polished">Polished</option></select></label><label>Technology<select name="technology"><option value="">All technologies</option><option>Canvas 2D</option><option>SVG</option><option>JavaScript</option><option value="WebGL">WebGL</option><option value="Web Audio">Web Audio</option></select></label><label class="il-favorites-filter"><input type="checkbox" name="favorites"/> Favorites only</label></form>
  <div class="il-result-line"><p data-results role="status">{experiments.length} studies · {working} working / {planned} planned</p><button class="il-text-button" type="button" data-clear-filters>Clear filters</button></div>
  <div class="il-catalog-grid">{experiments.map(e=><article class:list={['il-card',{'il-working':!e.placeholder}]} data-card data-slug={e.slug} data-search={`${e.name} ${e.description} ${e.tags.join(' ')} ${e.plannedTechnology||''}`.toLowerCase()} data-category={e.category} data-status={e.status} data-technology={`${e.technology.join(' ')} ${e.plannedTechnology||''}`}>
   <a class="il-card-art" href={url(`lab/${e.slug}/`)}><span class="il-card-number">{e.number}</span><img src={url(`lab/${e.slug}/plate.svg`)} alt={`${e.name} study illustration`} width="400" height="266" loading="lazy"/><span class="il-card-state">{e.placeholder?'PROTOTYPE / PLANNED':'WORKING STUDY'}</span><span class="il-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
   <div class="il-card-title"><h3><a href={url(`lab/${e.slug}/`)}>{e.name}</a></h3><button type="button" data-favorite={e.slug} aria-pressed="false" aria-label={`Favorite ${e.name}`}>☆</button></div><p>{e.description}</p><div class="il-tags"><span>{e.category}</span><span>{e.placeholder?e.plannedTechnology:e.technology[0]}</span></div>
   <label class="il-compare-choice"><input type="checkbox" data-compare={e.slug} data-eligible={String(e.comparison==='lightweight')} disabled={e.comparison!=='lightweight'}/> {e.comparison==='lightweight'?'Add to comparison':e.placeholder?'Live comparison after implementation':'Explore this study on its own'}</label>
  </article>)}</div>
  <p class="il-empty" data-empty hidden>No studies match. Try another word or clear the filters.</p>
  <div class="il-compare-tray" data-compare-tray hidden><span data-compare-count>0 selected</span><a class="il-button" data-compare-link href={url('lab/compare/')}>Compare the two studies ↗</a><button type="button" data-clear-compare class="il-text-button">Clear</button></div>
 </section>
 <section class="il-method" id="method"><span class="il-label">A LIBRARY, WITH THE BACKS LEFT OPEN.</span><div><h2>Keep the idea.<br/><em>Take the machinery.</em></h2><p>Every study has its own workbench, settings, notes, and source package. A ZIP contains the complete local implementation, an example you can run, a preset, and the license.</p><p>{working} studies are ready to explore, including Draw a World, Folding Paper, Living Ink, Particle Photos, Time Machine, Photo Portals, Living City, Site Memory, Spatial Sound, The Impossible Manuscript, and Light Peg Studio. The remaining {planned} plates are proposals, with clearly labeled scaffolds ready for development.</p><a class="il-button" href={url('lab/line-field/')}>Start with Line Field ↗</a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Find a gesture.</strong><p>Browse by discipline, technology, or stage. Favorites stay in this browser.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Make it your own.</strong><p>Adjust the drawing. Save or exchange settings as a small JSON file.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Bring it elsewhere.</strong><p>Download the source, or run <code>pnpm lab:export line-field</code> in this project.</p></div></li></ol></section>
</LabLayout>
